        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "21 Holywell Court, Swords, Co. Dublin\r\n\r\n **Cash Buyers Only**  \r\n\r\n\r\nExcellent location \r\nGood condition throughout \r\nFronting on to a green Ample Communal parking \r\nExcellent public transport links \r\nMinutes from Airside and all it's ameneties \r\nEasy access to the M1 and M50 motorways   \r\n\r\nStanley Estate Agents are delighted to present 21 Holywell Court to the market for sale. This spacious two-bedroom top floor apartment comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and offers strong appeal to cash buyers and investors seeking a well-located property with excellent potential.  \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway with stairs leading to the apartment, a bright and spacious lounge/dining area with access to a private balcony, fully fitted kitchen, utility room, two double bedrooms and a family bathroom.  \r\n\r\nHolywell Court is ideally located close to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, schools, crèches, sporting facilities and recreational areas. The property is also well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes nearby, while the M1 motorway provides easy access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the wider motorway network.  \r\n\r\nThere are ample communal parking spaces available to the front of the property.  \r\n\r\nPlease note: This property is available to cash buyers only. Further details are available upon request."
